00:02:30.598 --> 00:02:34.923
But the history of House Stark can be traced all the way back to the High King of the First Men,

00:02:35.036 --> 00:02:36.156
Garth Greenhand

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:38.523
He's one of the former rulers of the First Men

00:02:38.523 --> 00:02:41.496
that a lot of people up in The North can trace their lineage to

