00:04:54.765 --> 00:04:57.412
A lot of you have also probably heard the term ‘Kings of Winter’

00:04:57.412 --> 00:05:00.632
so that’s just the term given to rulers of House Stark

00:05:00.632 --> 00:05:04.029
Like rulers of The North that predated Aegon’s Conquest

